abstract: >-
  SAW-1 documents an ETQ-101-informed generative music chain and the later
  recognition that the lyric "Three beats to two" exactly reproduces the
  ordered dimensional signature (3,2) of a separately authored extra-time
  entanglement proposal. The note distinguishes deterministic source geometry,
  generative audio transformation, exact numerical correspondence, interpretive
  analogy, and unsupported causal claims.
